{"id":"anuncio","lemma":"anuncio","pos":"noun","rank":1816,"glosses":["announcement","notice","commercial"],"ipa":"/aˈnunθjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"anuncios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-anuncio.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es tu anuncio favorito?","en":"What's your favorite commercial?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684442","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"favorite/favourite"}]},{"text":"¿Qué acaba de decir el anuncio?","en":"What did the announcement just say?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to say"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tengo un gran anuncio que darles.","en":"I have a big announcement to make.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"}]},{"text":"Él recortó el anuncio del periódico.","en":"He cut the advertisement out of the newspaper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705857","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"periodic"}]},{"text":"Estoy harto de ver anuncios emergentes.","en":"I'm sick of seeing pop-up ads.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, fed up"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},null,null]}]}